<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Dae Han Pulp H1 net loss shrinks.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dae Han Pulp H1 net loss shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won, both losses)	     626    vs  1,943</p>
<p>    Net loss				   0.78 vs	4.02</p>
<p>    Loss before tax			  0.78 vs	4.02</p>
<p>    Turnover				 119.55 vs    117.32</p>
<p>Note - Dae Han Pulp Co Ltd is South Korea's leading duplex board and sanitary paper producer. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
